  str_pet_skin_name_1601863 = "Dreaming of Spring",
  str_pet_skin_name_1501004 = "Quietude For Two",
  str_pet_skin_name_1500213 = "Of Love Eternal",
  str_pet_skin_name_1602333 = "Summer's Sparkling Blossoms",
  str_pet_skin_name_1501903 = "Languid Opulence",
  str_pet_skin_name_1602273 = "Falcon's Call Over High Seas",
  str_pet_skin_name_1601733 = "Crimson Indulgence",
  str_pet_skin_name_1602183 = "Ambitious Proposal",
  str_pet_skin_name_1500973 = "Steel Strokes",
  str_pet_skin_name_1400953 = "Vigilante's Salvation",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500333 = "Vice chose a simple and comfortable swimsuit to attend the Ocean Sovereign festival. This swimsuit adopts a specially structured design to precisely match Vice's wearing habits and allows her tail to be placed freely. In addition to its special structure, look carefully and you'll notice that the black and gold sun cover also suits her vibrant personality. As her ice crusher crunches away, this short-haired beauty sends you an invitation to join her in the water with a smile. Beach volleyball, ice-cold drinks, the shaved ice cart... during that summer, you and Vice shared some deeply personal memories.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600063 = "A white swimsuit designed for girls, inspired by the Ocean Sovereign celebration. Adopts an elegant lace-up style popular among the ladies of the Lumopolis nobility. When blown by the sea breeze, the thin gossamer shawl can often help to block the sun's rays to a certain extent. Carleen's long-time concern of where to place her pendant is perfectly solved by this swimsuit's design. When wearing this swimsuit, Carleen seems able to forget the troubles of her noble standing for a while and can simply enjoy the refreshing summer as a girl should.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601033 = "A devilish swimsuit that won over Eicy with its charm the moment she saw it. The metal chain, the heart-shaped eye mask, the black and gold circlet... The overall design radiates delicate detail and luxury. However, the dark lace hem and complex cross braided design make its overall shape all the more playful. The interlacing braids reflect Eicy's own interweaving with the void... but for some reason, whenever Eicy wears this swimsuit, one can also hear the faint sound of a cat's meow.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500763 = [[
Kleken believes that men should also take sunscreen seriously, and that is why he chose this heroic three-piece swimsuit perfect for both deep-sea adventuring and blocking out the sun.
Following the classic color code of Umbraton, this outfit strongly echoes Kleken's trademark style. The deep open collar helps to dissipate the summer heat, and it also seems like it can accommodate a few more tentacles. Besides, the sun-shielding attachment allows even the most solar-adverse gentleman to move freely around the beach where there's no place to hide from the sun's rays. This outfit even allows Kleken to appear more comfortable in the water, and seems to convey the message that he wishes to enjoy a glass of wine with you in the shallows.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400863 = "Part of the White Maiden series designed for the Ocean Sovereign celebration. Its impeccable pure white glow has been specially selected to reflect the innocence and piety inseparable from Uriah's identity. Flower vines appear around her, silently heeding her call. To others, her state of mind remains unchanged. Only the flowers around her know the truth—when standing in full view by the seaside, she cannot help but feel a little shy in this outfit. The sunny sky, the salty ocean breeze, the cold seawater... When she waves her ceremonial sword, the most beautiful and poetic music will play once more.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600023 = "A classic discontinued Illumina Military Academy uniform. The windbreaker coat and bodysuit allow Hiiro to adapt to different temperatures and environments during her patrols. Finding the pants to be too loose, Hiiro utilized leather attachments to make them fit better, allowing her to deal with all kinds of emergencies at any given time. The red scarf wrapped around her arm represents her unwavering will from when this uniform was issued.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600113 = "An outfit worn by Sharona for a mysterious occasion. According to those who work with her, at this time of year, Sharona changes into this outfit and heads to an undisclosed location. This outfit is characterized by its bow and ruffles, continued all the way to her ankles, and is reminiscent of the formal attire of Lumopolis nobility. At a glance, it may seem like Sharona is on her way to a grand ball, but her furrowed brows tell a different story.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500334 = "Provided by the Cloud Blossom Hotel, this robe exemplifies the local Cloud Mountain style. This yukata was tailor-made for Vice. It comes with a unique sash and pendant, as well as adorable bells, creating a gentle air somewhat uncharacteristic of Vice. Whenever she puts on this yukata, she recalls that unforgettable and precious memory.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500423 = "\"Sergeant Hvit! Sergeant Ulv! Hold your breath and dive!\" Barton mutters. Now, he is ready to conquer the sea in style, wearing a cooling white overshirt, a striped nautical tee, and a smock perfect for the ever-changing weather on the high seas... as well as his darkened military cap bearing the Illumina insignia. Rather than a relaxing vacation, Barton seems to be out on a military mission on behalf of Illumina.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400853 = "An eerily alluring outfit composed of a captivating top, elegant skirt, beautifully woven sleeves, a ceremonial veil, and stylish boots... Not only is Jane's outfit stunning, the flowers along the hem of her skirt also hold some special meaning. Why would she choose to wear this kind of attire when she prides herself on being an outsider?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600253 = "A vampire descends in the darkness, ferrying souls across a sea of fire. Charon personally designed this stunning black and red performance outfit, which simultaneously exudes a classic, romantic, peculiar, and alluring air for this performance alone! He, of course, is the director, the writer, and the star, so please raise your glasses and applaud as the grand spectacle begins!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400573 = "As Philyshy curls up in bed wearing her fuzzy pajamas, she falls into a deep sleep and dreams a beautiful afternoon dream. In this dream, Yumi is beside her, hugging her and stroking her hair—like a little personal heater, warming her heart and taking her back to simpler times.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500923 = "Stop staring at me...!\nCould anything be more embarrassing? Entwining thorns lifting Pact's feet, tearing her silk stockings and black veil to pieces. Amid the chaos, Pact tries to balance the glass of red wine in her hand—it seems that this dignified and luxurious dress is not as easy to control as it looks.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1401023 = "This simple outfit embodies the essence of what it means to have a burning soul, and in the dark, oppressive confines of the underground arena, it serves as the only guiding light. Renegades take the stage, fighting with robust bodies, spirit, and perseverance, their blood burning like fire. They rage like blazing meteors, then fade away like ashes. She snaps her fingers, ready to hunt down all in her sights.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600933 = "In her leisure time, Migard likes to wear close-fitting, comfortable clothes with enticing elements, and just in case she needs to carry out experiments anytime, she always brings along a nice clean white coat. As a dedicated and severe scientist, she never stops studying and working—even when sitting in her lounge in her spare time. In fact, you could say that her lounge is no different from her strange laboratory.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601113 = "After arriving at the beach, even the usually melancholy Beryl is more relaxed than usual. This swimsuit is quite minimalist, but it's still able to accentuate Beryl's figure every now and then. However, she's oblivious to this and completed fixated on building her sandcastle. That is perhaps Beryl's favorite thing about this beach trip.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600013 = "A lake as clear as a mirror, its ripples cascade into the horizon at a single touch. Nikinis leans forward, wrapped in a warm winter shawl and a snow-white fishtail gown. At this moment, she should have been the belle of the ball, as beautifully radiant as the Aurora above, but she chose to come to Lake Mirror alone. Cold, dark, and far from the bustling crowd and bright lights, this is a silent paradise that belongs solely to her and her reflection.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600014 = [[
"Can you recall those beautiful white flowers? Two stems growing in harmony by the tranquil lake."
"One was a delicate narcissus, the other a pristine lily."
"Though distinct in form, their souls were one."
"One bore leaves, the other bloomed with flowers. They sipped the morning dew, their roots forever intertwined."]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600383 = "This is bad! Gronru is stuck in her toy box and can't get out! To celebrate the coming of the New Year, Gronru has a surprise gift for you! Just look at how cute she is, stuffed in there with a pile of toys in that festive red and white outfit—she even tied up her mechanical arm with a pretty bow! Just try to ignore the deadly-looking bomb in her hand...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500993 = "Areia curls up coyly on the sofa, her bare legs, shoes discarded to one side, and quaint dress indicating that she has just returned from a ball. Like a fairytale princess, her graceful, magical gown will disappear with the ticking of the clock, but this memory—this time spent with you—will never disappear or fade.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400453 = "As the snow begins to fall and winter arrives with it. Now, the empty streets are filled only with the flicker of warm yellow lights. If you are a lonely traveler, don't worry about losing your way. Just look around the corner—your carriage awaits. With a white tuxedo, black boots, slick, shining hair, and elegant manners, a discreet and quiet gentleman has been waiting to give you a ride.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600193 = "A scorched rose maintains its vital posture and then crumbles into ashes. Victoria stares at herself in the mirror, turning her head only upon detecting your presence behind her. Her luxurious dress spins in the air, and her eyes lock onto yours—eyes so deep that you cannot help but sink into the abyss with her.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600263 = "What is the meaning of existence for an incorporeal consciousness? After putting on these strange clothes, the baffling question lingers in Uriel's mind, compelling her to ponder it without end. Can she find the answer in the world of simulated literature? Who knows. But you can walk, think, and feel along with her quest.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400543 = "Stern and serious is Nadine's modus operandi. Never tiring, she always performs her duties. Even with her new spring outfit and cute little lantern, her character shines through.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500883 = "Blue sky, white clouds, smooth streets—this doesn't look like the Rediesel Desert. Maggie looks very different as well with her crisp, clean sailor's uniform, and bow tie blowing in the wind. On this bright morning, you can see her riding leisurely, nibbling her bread. Won't she be late for school?\n\nThis outfit makes Maggie stand out among the Rediesel Wrenches, and it also lets her view different scenery. Maybe this is part of its magic?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600963 = "Um, teacher? Is it Sariel? It seems Sariel takes her second job seriously. She even put on the uniform! This new Sariel seems much more reliable than the old one. She speaks gently and eloquently. Perhaps soon you'll be able to take a lesson from her!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601053 = "The clothing might be ordinary, but Eve is still Miss Popularity in Rediesel Wrench. Even she doesn't know how popular she is. And now, as a cheerleader, she's even more loved after putting on this outfit! Just don't stare, or you'll get a wrench to the face!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600064 = [[
This light, silky smooth garment covered in ribbons... pajamas?! Why would anyone design such a thing? How is one supposed to wear it in front of others? Troubled, Carleen was at a loss at how to proceed, so she decided to try it on first, but she wasn't expecting to feel completely different from her usual serious self.
In order to join the slumber party and have a good time with everyone, Carleen decided to take the plunge.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600303 = "Jet black sleeves and a crimson cloak. Presenting, the samurai who rid the world of evildoers—Shinnosuke!\nAs leader of the Rediesel Wrench, Sinsa practices the principle of \"do as the locals do.\" Be it the clothes he wears or the blade at his waist, they're a perfect representation of Cloud Island's charm, and even his laughter seems to be entirely spontaneous. But be warned, if this ronin samurai's in the right mood, he might recite an impromptu poem and sing a song...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400443 = [[
The breeze blows through the pines, and the warm sunshine lightens the hall. When you get away from the hustle-bustle of the city and endless work, why not take the opportunity to rest at the peaceful Cloud Mountain Hotel? Vivian's work-life balance principle is the true way to regain strength and energy before resuming work!
Of course, this must all be planned!]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600643 = "Wrath's new combat outfit is woven from oriental silk threads, not only slim-fitting but also elegant and graceful. Although it looks a little thin, it's easy to move around in, and it doesn't seem to impede her fighting ability at all.\nThrowing punches and flexing her muscles, rushing in and removing all obstacles in her path—no matter what dangers come her way, the unwavering Wrath will meet them headlong!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600893 = [[
To make the most of this rare holiday, Irridon prepared Cloud Island style clothes. The gold fabric adorned with embroidery paired with a snow-white fur cape looks simply magnificent. She was keen to wear her outfit out on a stroll through Cloud Island's streets or take a ride on the train to enjoy the sights.
However, sudden events upended all her plans, and in order to protect her vacation, Irridon didn't hesitate to turn Cloud Island's station into the Hall of Justice.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1300653 = [[
"Navigator, come pway hanetsuki with me!"
Tweety was in such excitement as she approached. But who knew a fun casual game was going to turn into a relentless battle for the top?! With such magnificent serves and strong drop shots, it's impossible for an ordinary player to survive!
Whoever loses the game will be punished by getting their faces drawn on. One can only hope that Tweety shows some mercy and controls herself a little...]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600233 = [[
Though shy by nature, Connolly decided to help cheer on her friends participating in the races. However, compared to what she was used to wearing daily, this uniform was really "something else."
Nonetheless, Connolly accepted the bold outfit pitched to her by a salesman in the hopes of becoming more outgoing.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500843 = [[
"As hot as desert sand and as fresh as spring water, a juxtaposition of the modern and the traditional."
"Shocking and outrageous..."
Though reviews varied wildly, the minute Istvan donned his costume, all criticisms fell away. Though better suited for a grand hall, even here he exudes the charisma of a superstar. Perhaps it's the aura of the "Shadowlord" himself that lends an extra charm factor.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600603 = [[
A race judge's outfit always stands out. After all, in order for racers to spot the judges at high speeds, they'll need to stand out.
Jona, who only applied for the job because she needed money to cover her bar tab, soon discovered the race's dark secrets. Though she had intended to mind her own business, she ended up heading to the track for the sake of a little girl, determined to bring justice down on the crooks heading the fixed races.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500713 = [[
The scorching sun causes racecars to emit columns of smoke, and sweat evaporates with a hiss as soon as it hits the ground.
Even so, Taki enters the races "fully prepared", determined to best his opponents. But is he really only in it for the money?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400613 = [[
"Ooh... So this is what the continent looks like!"
Chandra, high up in the clouds, has no fear of heights at all. As she watches the rally taking place far below, the intense competition causes her to exclaim from time to time. But... what's with the hot air balloon and her strange outfit?
Turns out it's all part of her mysterious "visualization therapy," which does seem to help people release pent-up emotions.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600103 = [[
"A clean and tidy outfit is the pride of a maid"!
Put on the maid suit Lita sewed by hand and the lace-trimmed headband. Oh, don't forget to put on the apron with the golden bow knot.
Today Louise has to help the master get dressed and organize an afternoon tea. Don't worry, the bees, fawns, and even the clouds will help.
Look! The maid has started working already.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600283 = [[
Ahem, let's give a warm welcome to the Head Maid of Upton Manor! What, she looks familiar? Yes, you are right. This is our lovely Raphael!
Recently, she received a special assignment to train the maids of Lumopolis in battle skills. Now the semester is drawing to its end, the maids, under the careful guidance of Raphael, have all achieved excellent results. It's just... Rafael's career as a maid doesn't seem to be going so well.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400673 = "The breeze blows, and the fluffy white dress sways gently, revealing the embroidered red flowers. Alice's outfit somehow reminds people of... a type of cake. Yes. The strawberry cake one can only taste at birthday parties. But at Dream Dessert House, you can try any dessert you want for free as long as you answer the questions of Alice, the owner, honestly. This is Alice's special punishment for you. Oops, I mean... special \"reward.\"",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601163 = [[
Fleur spent a lot of time and effort trying to make the bread in his memory, but he never succeeded.
This time, Fleur was better prepared. He changed into a neatly sewn shirt, a properly ironed apron, and put on polished shoes. The outfit is said to be the guarantee for making great bread. As cheesy as that sounds, Fleur still chose to believe it for the sake of his heart's content.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601263 = "The best-selling author, who is caught in a creative bottleneck, dresses up nicely, planning to wander the streets for ideas. What's the point of dressing up? Perhaps, it's because she does not want people to know that the majestic guild manager has such a \"girlish\" hobby in private.\nBut be careful not to underestimate Bethel's dedication to her hobby—she is willing to risk it all just for a flash of inspiration...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500703 = "Under Leona's sharp scrutiny, you feel the air around you heat up and your breath shortens. Is it because of nerves? Indeed, who wouldn't be nervous in front of the powerful and beautiful Leona? With strappy sandals wrapped around her legs and her body adorned with accessories, she looks very different from her usual self. Still, she effortlessly exudes the feeling that everything in the world is her oyster.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400813 = "This is the costume that Brock specially prepared for himself in search of a certain \"something.\" Swimming trunks that help him get around easily, a surfboard in his special style, and a transparent coat that's reminiscient of a raincoat. Transparent coat? Let's be frank, the real reason Brock designed a transparent coat was probably to fish for compliments from us—Behold, that body of his built from protein powder and hard exercise, of sunshine and sweat, is longing for your praise.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601123 = "A popular urban legend in Umbraton recently. Calling cards, thieves wrecking chaos all over, a stolen gem... Is our key suspect the careless Smokey after all? If you want to know the truth, I'm afraid you will have to unlock her handcuffs first. Of course, her new title is as intriguing as her new clothes—\"Black Cat,\" who will come and pick up the gems in three days, just as promised.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600384 = "Did this outfit come first, or did the game that this outfit accompanied come first? It doesn't matter anymore. The important thing is that Gronru prepared this especially for her vacation and entered holiday mode right away after wearing it. Even if she is just going to the aquarium for a day and not the beach.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400413 = "How many identities does she have? She's the Guide of Lumopolis, but she has many other responsibilities as well. One of them is to serve as the public ambassador for the Tir' Hotel. This swimsuit she's wearing is for a flyer's photoshoot. Delicate and precise, it's made of the most exquisite material. Looking at her, one can't help but wonder about this hotel she's promoting.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500873 = "Beverly wears this swimsuit of armor to fit in better with the local environment when she visits her family's island territory. Although it is much more minimalistic than her usual attire, her aristocratic aura is too strong to hide, not only because of her warrior familial roots, but also because of her pursuit of a noble's honor.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601293 = "Although he is dressed in cool summer clothes, his serious gaze informs everyone that he is not here to relax but to complete a compulsory mission. This outfit allows Luke to maintain his stamina in the hot and humid forest, and it is also a formal outfit specially prepared to be worn in the fight to protect precious butterflies from shameless poachers.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601483 = "The water party in the desert is about to begin, but what makes a lot of people particularly excited is the opportunity to witness Azure's amazing figure! She's especially alluring under the sheer clothing... Ahem, please control yourself and don't stare for too long! Enjoying a warm, humid evening breeze, listening to loud music, and dancing with a crowd from time to time is a blast!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600254 = "A magnificent stage outfit that gives off an elegant air of ancient nobility. It looks quite out of place with today's fashion, but that is because Charon designed his new costume to be this way. Extravagant as it may be, it quickly grabs the audience's attention whenever Charon stands before the camera, granting him the opportunity to showcase his unforgettably impressive acting skills at their full potential. In those moments, it can be said that both Charon and his costume were made for acting.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400683 = "Extra, extra! A recent collaboration between the Courier Union and the Umbraton newspapers gives couriers an added job: newspaper subscription sales. And thus, Wendy dons her brand-new papergirl uniform and sets off on her newspaper selling endeavors with her characteristic excitement and diligence! Wendy's speedy and spirited nature never lets her fall behind her peers, even when she's taking on an unfamiliar task!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501003 = "Sikare, usually bound to the past, has switched up her regular looks for a new one to deal with an unexpected situation. While she looks like a regular doctor, the contents of her briefcase is filled with medical instruments that are anything but ordinary. This is because she must not only attend to the maladies of the living, but to the wishes of the dearly departed as well...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601203 = "Thanks to popular demand, Hedy ends up participating in an exchange event meant to foster unity and cooperation between the Illumina Federation and Lumopolis. At her superiors' behest, she travels to Gannon City to act as a sheriff for a day, promoting traffic safety and crime prevention on the streets. Despite being a proud knight of Lumopolis, Hedy obeys and dons her Federation uniform. Though she finds it somewhat uncomfortable, it does not obscure her natural charm and confidence.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601193 = "Revy intentionally lands herself in jail in her endeavor to obtain a legendary hot sauce of her memories, heading into danger alone. Behind those massive stone walls, she finds herself surrounded by hardened criminals from criminally-rampant areas. A perilous situation, indeed... Can Revy, who hails from the Illumina Federation and has never before experienced the chaotic dangers of such a place, succeed in her special undercover mission?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601194 = "Gronru has developed a new piece of equipment, one that can turn anyone into a hero in the hearts of children everywhere. Out of curiosity, Revy heads to Gronru's lab and arrives in a specially prepared room. She changes into an outfit designed by Gronru herself: a jumpsuit with an attached helmet that only a petite girl like Revy could possibly wear. After donning her uniform, Revy picks up Gronru's cutting-edge technological invention, the \"Eclipsite Vacuum Cleaner,\" and begins her journey to become a true hero.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601173 = "Despite being covered in scars from head to toe, Gram stands alone in a clear pool and prepares to begin his special training. In his eyes, his many scars are symbols of honor, the witnesses of every blade that failed to strike him down in all his years of battle. True warriors never fall!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600234 = "An elegant and tastefully-adorned dress that exudes the beauty and majesty of the ocean... In this dress, Connolly resembles a deep-sea fairy, one who cannot avoid drawing the attention of everyone around her. While she insists that the dress is only rented and that she shouldn't obsess over her dreams, her three invisible friends believe otherwise. With this dress, Connolly will definitely make certain parts of her dream become reality, like her love and her courage.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400163 = [[
After agreeing to train with you in the desert, Kafka finishes her own training early.
In the scorching sands, Kafka is dressed in light and breathable clothes, taking shelter under an awning to cool off. As she teases Franz, she looks in your direction from time to time; she seems a bit concerned about you.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501653 = [[
After Ciel and her mecha are trapped beneath a collapsed cave, snowflakes start to gently fall and fill the gaps between the rubble.
Thankfully, Ciel's Illumina engineering suit is equipped with a state-of-the-art insulation system to keep her warm.
There is still a faint, inexplicable light emanating from within her mecha, so this cave-in offers the perfect opportunity to study it without interruption. The only problem is that her mecha's interior is somewhat cramped, making it difficult for Ciel to even stretch her legs while she works.

]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601213 = "A beautiful, crimson flower adorned with countless, vicious thorns: everything about Paloma's appearance screams, \"approach at your own peril.\" Coupled with a faint smile, an air of cold elegance surrounds her. Those who lay eyes on this deadly damsel know in their hearts that provoking her would be the last thing they ever do. Incurring the wrath of the most sinister Umbraton crime lord would be a wiser decision by comparison. Or has she already become a crime lord...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500123 = "One day, a legend suddenly emerged in Gannon—that of the \"Enforcer of Justice\" aka \"The Punisher.\" A sudden flash of lightning splits open the sky whenever someone breaks the rules, and Nemesis appears beside them to hand down thunderous punishment. After doing so, she delivers a one-liner that cuts them to the bone and forces them to repent. After executing her justice, she disappears in a flash of light to punish another evildoer.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600773 = "You and Queen Bethlehem discover an old journal that once belonged to Shaya. She was well aware of her inevitable mission, so she imagined an entirely different future—she wished to become a painter, a poet, or even a singer and realize her dream before the time finally came. But before the two could finish reading the rest, the old notebook succumbed to the passage of time and crumbled in their hands, along with that beautiful past and its hopes for the future.\n\"... Perhaps she could have had a different future after all.\" And so, Queen Bethlehem inquires about the famous singers of the land, intent on rewriting Shaya's long-lost dream.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400833 = "In order to awaken Lilin, who they defend so ardently, they must... become idols? Even so, they seem to rigidly abide by their programming as maids. Can they really make it to the top of a profession where vitality and creativity are crucial? Well, if there is a blueprint they can follow, and their number advantage can be utilized somehow, it might be possible...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601313 = "Although he maintains his unique perspective of the world, Novio becomes a master pianist the instant he dons this new look. He brings warmth and goodwill to the strong-hearted survivors of Northland, and encourages a certain special audience member to persevere and move forward resolutely, forever striving for self-improvement.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601383 = "Although her superior forces her to take part in the idol competition, Siobhan still does her utmost to prepare well. While working on her talents, she also devotes considerable effort to researching and designing the perfect outfit. This unyielding spirit of scientific research brings about an amazing transformation in Siobhan—her shining light that cannot be extinguished, the unignorable road to future stardom.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600273 = "She is a horror among the lovers of Lumopolis—Each Mooncrown Day, there will be a knight in white patrolling all corners of the city, looking for those in love. As soon as she finds one, she will immediately issue a \"Ban on Falling in Love.\" Therefore, she is known as the \"lightning strike that breaks love,\" which terrifies lovers.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500553 = "Unlike his usual professional look, Pittman seems to have been influenced by the festivity of Mooncrown Day when he chose his outfit. It carries a gentleness not often seen in him without losing his usual firmness and elegance. Of course, this is not because he is spoken for, but simply to be a qualified messenger and fulfill a long-cherished wish of someone else.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400913 = "In Chloe's world, love always comes with separation, so it would be a little too much to ask her to play the music that celebrates sweet love. In that case, we might praise the eternal love in the name of God—people's affections may fade after a few years, but worry not, the light will bless and love everyone equally.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601673 = "There is no shortage of all sorts of magic tricks in a social place like this, but a sense of mystery is the key to all of them. A card, a word, or even just a glance. One could complete the grand and exquisite performance in a moment of inattention with none the wiser. Although there is no applause like usual, it's a good deal for Jeno when he wants to do favors for his friends once in a while.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600043 = "A cold corpse, marked clues, cordon after cordon... Such a classic and suspenseful scene can always make everyone's imagination go wild. For instance, the detective could be the murderer or colluding with the murderer, the murderer could be hiding among us, or all the witnesses could be murderers... Who would have thought the deceased and the detective were working together?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400483 = "An ominous atmosphere crept into the peaceful streets of Umbraton. Although passers-by on the street seemed to enjoy the quiet night, the vigilant eyes of one particular patrol officer watch closely to capture all traces of sin. As long as they are hiding in this city, she, the guardian of peace, will not stop patrolling the streets. Everything is for... her one and only sister!",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601484 = "An office with bright and clean windows, a soft sofa, intoxicating wine, and the interim director half lying down on the sofa. Don't let her lazed demeanor deceive you—this beautiful woman is dangerous, especially to the one who would soon become her prey, in a literal way.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601663 = "\"Well... where are those cute little ones?\" To find those wondrous beasts and expose the truth, Fia becomes a detective and starts to investigate this mysterious case carefully by examining all kinds of evidence and considering the key points of suspicion. Looking at how earnest and hardworking she looks, maybe she really will discover something.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500983 = "Under the order of the Shadowlord, the reclusive Cuscuta is tasked to be a detective and catch rampant criminals. Though she struggles with street visits and witness interviews, her keen intuition allows her to deduce the criminal's identity from the clues at hand. From the comfort of her chair, she observes the chess game and loses herself in contemplation until she finds the answer through deduction.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601034 = "People should not commit crimes, or they will face condemnation from the heavens, which is known in the mortal world as trial, judgment, and punishment. Of course, the process is not as terrifying as it sounds, especially when Eicy becomes your interrogation officer. The gentle girl never relies on violence to break down a person's defenses... Or rather, those defenses are useless in the first place. So if you ever meet her, don't put up a pointless fight. Just leave everything to Eicy.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400623 = "To ensure the study session organized by Leah goes smoothly, Sylva made a special effort to don this formal attire, resembling a young scholar ready to meet his esteemed teacher—intelligent, wise, and well-mannered. His demeanor effortlessly infused the study session with a positive atmosphere, earning him the title of a 'model student'...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1300463 = "To adults, it may be a frightful grimoire of black magic, but to them, it is a gateway into a wondrous realm of fantasy, enchantment, and extraordinary wonders crafted exclusively for their inquisitive and spirited souls. To concoct the forbidden potion, they tirelessly search for peculiar ingredients, donning unique attire that only further accentuates their individuality.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600293 = "In order to honor the master's final wish, Gabriel donned a magnificent gown and ventured to the orphanage in Umbraton. The gloomy and rundown surroundings contrasted with the exquisite attire, and Gabriel's somewhat clumsy actions led the orphans to mistake her for a witch. But in the end, the orphans sensed Gabriel's heartfelt dedication to safeguarding their home, and the dress itself seemed to radiate a comforting light.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601433 = [[
While traveling the forest at night, ominous beings are said to linger in the world following a thunderstorm. For this reason, Rinne dons her ceremonial garments and holds the Kagura Bell high, ready to purge vile presences from this world in defense of the living.
"An ode to the dead and the living. May this song accompany you to the other side of the River Lethe."
"The River Lethe flows. Resentment and bitterness grow."
"The datura sings in harmony."
"Listen peacefully. Let your soul follow me."]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601214 = "In this attire, Paloma exudes an alluring yet enigmatic charm like a goddess and compels people to bow down and admire her. However, what Paloma despises most is this blind adoration. Just like the blackthorn flower adorned with sharp thorns, she aims not only to unmask the foolishness of blind obedience and faith but also to teach a lesson to those who dare to approach her without permission.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601054 = "The fabricated dream has faded away, and she sets out to find her beloved and that white flower. Opting to confront the pain, she breaks free from the confines woven by false dreams of happiness, no longer a puppet or a pawn. Finally, she gets what she longs for—basking in the real sunlight, running through true flower fields, and making that tiny wish come true.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601403 = "To explore an underwater ruin, Florine makes the bold choice to personally dive into the mysterious waters. Due to the time constraint, she only manages to find this strange swimsuit, which seems to have been salvaged from another ruin... Oddly enough, it perfectly matches Florine's other peculiar outfits, suggesting it could be a product of the same ruin.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601153 = "The Courier Union is always teeming with activity, and Naroxel, continuously forging ahead in her work, sometimes finds herself quite overwhelmed. To refresh herself, she decides to visit Quayside Beach to revel in the boundless colors of the ocean and inhale the salty, sandy sea breeze. It's clear to all how much she enjoys this moment of tranquility.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400793 = "Venturing deep into the Rediesel Desert, Michenny dons a refreshingly cool outfit to blend into the environment and evade unwanted attention seamlessly. After all, this place is a wilderness, far from the civilized Lumopolis. Michenny's journey to traverse this perilous land is all for a unique little cat...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600774 = "The Northland's icy realms have crafted a frosty scepter for Bethlehem to rule while entwining her in a weighty protective cloak. Every now and then, a glimpse of her like this sparks the imagination—As winter fades away, could scorching summer melt her mask away? Could the evening sea breeze on a sultry day stretch her wings and coax a blossoming smile, much like it does for all thriving lives?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601783 = "Gold coins amassed like hills, treasures scattered all over the ground—A mysterious treasure protected by the legendary last Ouroboros suddenly manifests in the realm! With a mere thread of a clue, can those brave adventures overcome treacherous odds to locate this treasure and safely escape from the Ouroboros' vigilant grasp? Or will they be devoured by the beast the moment they lay eyes on the trove?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501573 = "Sanae stirs from her slumber in Nina's museum, still groggy and eager to escape her somewhat eerie surroundings. Just then, a nearby puppet flashes a strange smile, as footsteps echo from the darkness, growing closer and closer...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500563 = "After a prolonged journey, Constantine finally returned to the familiar grounds of his long-abandoned homeland. Dressed to the nines and with his weapon honed and ready, he faced the Eclipsites with unwavering resolve. He was determined to extinguish their existence, regardless of their multitude. The specter of past tragedies would not be allowed to cast a shadow over this land again.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602113 = [[
Time stood still a century ago, and everything now is just a memory.
As Zarya stands in the shallow sea, what should have been a pleasant late summer outing turns into a melancholic ordeal due to the gloomy weather. It dredges up memories of a past filled with regret and family members she can no longer reach.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600894 = "Irridon, entangled with her complex emotions towards her father, immersed herself in a dreamland beneath the Golden Ripples. There, she became a fledgling Justice Knight, serving the Hall of Justice. Guided by her subconscious, she revisited the cases her father once went through. What constitutes fairness? What defines justice? With a solemn vow, Irridon pledged, using her sword and staff, to forge a balance robust enough to uphold the city in the sky.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601563 = "Nina drapes herself in amber gemstones, each as if they were her attire. Facing the blinding flashlight, Nina continually adjusts her posture under the spotlight. Each tiny alteration will determine whether Nina can claim victory in the Gemstone Championship. This time, she must outshine everyone, like the brilliant gemstones.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400544 = "A legendary tower in Longzhou stands fearlessly in the wind and rain, providing warmth and succor to all lives at sea. In this moment, Nadine is the living embodiment of that wondrous tower. As night falls and the ocean fog fills the air, the luminous lantern held high in her hands becomes a beacon of hope. This is Nadine's wish: to serve as a light in the boundless sea and lead wayward ships home to safety. Her lantern's flame offers guidance and blessings to lost and tired travelers.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601883 = "At twelve years of age, Dantang dances as beautifully as an immortal in a vivid dream. A brilliant light reflected on the ocean's surface shimmers and dances with her. The waves rise and fall like mountains, as magnificent and mysterious as this dream-like girl. Storm-weathered ships sail to and fro like countless schools of fish. Her future self will realize her dream of bringing the prosperity of a thousand ships to every corner of the world.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600964 = "Due to an all-too-familiar problem, Sariel finds yet another new part-time job, this time in a crowded and luxurious gaming house. In this place, every patron tests their luck to see if they can win big. Surely a job like this should pay really well! But why does the uniform have to be so asymmetrical? This has to be some sick form of torture! Reluctantly, Sariel dons her strange new outfit and adds yet another odd job to her work history.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600065 = "To fit in with the locals, Carleen is given the chance to wear an outfit from Longzhou, which fits surprisingly well. Aside from its very majestic appearance, her new outfit comes with a pair of weapons that are also surprisingly easy to wield. Unfortunately, Carleen's new attire leads others to mistake her for a wandering warrior. As a result, she finds herself in an unfamiliar setting and has a strange confrontation with an uninvited visitor...",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500335 = "In the distant land of Longzhou, legends speak of the Dragon Maiden, a deity who blesses voyagers with fair weather and safe passage. To express their gratitude and honor her achievements, the people of Longzhou hold regular ceremonies in her name. For this reason, a young lady with a gift for dance is chosen to wear the Dragon Maiden's ceremonial garments and perform the divine dance which she used to appease the storming seas.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601723 = "Lilica receives an invitation to perform at an orphanage. To give the children the best performance possible, she carefully crafts her stage image and even prepares a festive costume for the occasion. However, Lilica's costume doesn't seem particularly resistant to the cold; hopefully she doesn't catch a cold because of it.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501873 = "In the magnificent undersea Dragon Palace, Tianxian can be seen sitting lazily atop a seat of pearls, wearing plenty of gold and silver jewelry on his body and a smug smile on his face. He claims that his experience as a distinguished guest of the Dragon Palace is true to the last word... But can you honestly believe him?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400733 = "Upon arriving in an unfamiliar town, these two \"guard doggies\" from Astra were quickly mistaken for the Sinister Gatekeepers of local legend. Even after clearing the misunderstanding, they were still more than happy to continue their mischievous charade. Soon, the people of this town began to speak of a new superstition: \"Before Black Patty, one must flee or show restraint. Before White Patsy, one must pray for prosperity and good luck with proper tribute.\"",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600024 = "At Granny's behest, Hiiro returns to Cloud Island once more to investigate a disturbance of the mountain god's barrier. Before her last departure, Granny presented her with a beautiful outfit, the traditional garments of the Sakura Family. Hiiro decides to wear these clothes for the very first time, wishing to thank Granny for her countless years of hard work, and finally returns to her hometown with you.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601703 = "Pollux shares more of her past with you one day. Just within that one year, the once-bustling town of Euphoria was reduced to ruins, and the streets were filled with broken weapons and the cries of frightened children. In that same year, Pollux decided to inherit the will of her predecessor and bear the weight of guardianship. Now, the future she wishes to protect includes you as well.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500994 = "The lady boss from Longzhou is generous enough to buy Areia a luxurious outfit from one of the best tailors in Twin Pavilions Bay. The clothes are crafted from the finest silk, making them both supple and elegant. In addition, the outfit's adornments cover \"imperfections\" on her skin flawlessly. Anyone who sees her would assume she is the daughter of a noble family, out to patronize her favorite establishment. These beautiful garments serve as the perfect disguise for clandestine operations.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602163 = "Legend has it that in times of old chaos, the stars guided us in myriad ways. Yet, these celestial bodies lie forever beyond our reach, no matter how much we stretch on our tiptoes, thus becoming a dreamscape cherished by all beings on land. Now, Xuan Ji adorns her parasol with a fragment of the star map, creating a world for you that keeps out the wind and rain.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1401273 = "As a child, Pasolo dreamed of leaving the desert with her parents to see butterflies. However, as she grew up, she traveled alone—until she met you. Amidst the Spring Festival's bustle and dancing paper butterflies, you and her make a promise to treat each other like family.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500093 = "Text sparks truth. With it, the knowledge of ancestors is preserved and accumulated, transcending the torrents of time and becoming poetry that can be sung even millenniums later. In his scholar outfit, Faust is delving into these truths and texts in Twin Pavilions Bay today.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600264 = "Unable to bear the void, Uriel wishes to change her form of existence with a magical potion. Yet, the concoction leads not to the expected change, but to a whimsical tipsy. Gone is her customary despondency and aloofness, replaced by a newfound zestful spirit, craving thrilling adventures with you. How will you navigate through this unexpected turn of events?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601753 = [[
"After the rose withers, I will be utterly broken as well, right?"
Axelia, wounded in war, wakes up in her sickbed, only to find a rose meticulously cared for in a glass jar by her bedside. In this instance, a sudden surge of sentiments strikes her, convincing her of the impending descent into a fate of irreparable damage. In response, you, who sent her this Mooncrown Day promotional rose, decide to talk to her about the connection between fate, the rose, and herself...]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1701073 = "\"Let's greet the most celebrated civilian hero—he has weathered countless battles, and this time, he returns triumphant again, bringing victory to us all! Hear it, see it, and the entire city resounds with his name: Adras, Adras! He is poised to ascend to the heights of glory and bliss!\"",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1600114 = "Sharona, clad in ceremonial garb, paces in the ruins. Perhaps buried beneath the Dragon Idol are details about her ancient kin—how did they view this ominous Dragon Power? Did self-doubt consume them in the face of such strength? Ancient vows linger in the historical breeze, unsettling a powerful general. Can you provide her with a new oath to reignite the flames of faith?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1401013 = "Ever the prankster, Ansia now finds herself undergoing Honor Guard training as punishment for her shenanigans. You can't help but wonder how her ultimate training outcome will unfold.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500783 = "In the corner of Umbraton, Robyn dons comfortable yet stylish casual clothing, planning to relish a serene moment. Contrary to her usual stance of keeping others at bay, she unexpectedly invites you to her home.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601164 = "Fleur pops out from the water, holding the freshly retrieved parts. Beads of water drip from his hair as his intense gaze meets yours. In the glow of the evening sunset, what's brewing in his heart?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601773 = "You've won Goldie's fan prize, and now you're her manager for a day, tasked not only with busy work for the idol but also taking care of Goldie's everyday life. Back at the cozy home, Goldie slips into cute pajamas, eager to share her feelings with you.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500924 = "Pact finally has the chance to complete quests on her own and has been put in charge of procurement for the next party! To ensure things go smoothly, she uses some of the money she has saved up over the years to disguise herself as a rich and shrewd merchant. Surely those vendors who looked down on Pact before won't make the same mistake again, right?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601823 = [[
According to the secret recipe, the best snails to make the most delicious broth are right in this river.
Mu Yuebai and you meet by the riverside in the woods to search for these dreamily delicious snails.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602233 = [[
"May all the beauty of the world dance to your name, and may your wise leadership flourish for a thousand years."
During Longzhou's Festival of Colors, you and Chen'ni embark on an adventure to find "a certain wish." Everyone desires something, and when you get another chance to make a wish before the Almighty Benevolent Dragon Divinity, what will it be?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400403 = "Joanie Boom recently learned the old term \"Boom Boom BBQ,\" which is rumored to be an intense grilling method. But is it really okay to blow up the whole kitchen?",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500363 = "On Umbraton's streets, Hydrad looks out for isolated wild wolves. He's dedicated to fighting those who harm the pack, protecting his few \"partners.\" Despite claiming to be a loner, he's slowly opening up to unexpected encounters. Wolves are pack animals, and Hydrad is no exception, regardless of his denials.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601993 = [[
Under the blue sky, entangled weeds cover the traces of an ancient civilization.
Birds chirp busily, as if they are singing praises of this moment. Even Yingel, who is always serious, has changed into something both fashionable and casual. Standing there by the road, is she recalling that day, looking at the flocks of birds, or waiting for a chance encounter?
Your eyes lock gazes under the guidance of a mystifying gust of wind. Do you want to set off now? Would you like to join her while the song of freedom still fills the air...]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500424 = "Loose, practical short jacket, durable jeans, and leather boots—these were Barton's gear when he first joined the legion.\nThese simple items of clothing witness Barton's rise from a passionate soldier to a formidable general commanding thousands.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601553 = "Loose, practical short jacket, durable jeans, and leather boots—these were Barton's gear when he first joined the legion.\nThese simple items of clothing witness Barton's rise from a passionate soldier to a formidable general commanding thousands.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601843 = [[
If the purpose of swimwear on a warm and breezy beach is to bare your heart, imagine what a stunning sight it will show!?
Jeriah must have misunderstood something when she chose to wear such a daring swimsuit, prompting you to keep other beachgoers away from her.
And now, this sight is now for your eyes alone... Did she really misunderstand?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601533 = "The tailored suit is a monster—it swallows those who are plagued with timid, stage fright, or self-doubt. But it bows to Reinhardt, focusing only on showcasing her strength and poise.\nThe fine tailoring fits her shape perfectly, highlighting every well-honed part of her. The sleek design never goes out of style, bursting with sharpness on her because she is meant to lead the era.\nThe suit is her battle armor tonight, and the wine glass is her spear. Armed and sharp, she strides into the feast as Illumina's Grand Marshal, the diplomat with a vision for the future.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500903 = [[
The blazing sun, the alluring sea, and the passionate stage!
Barbara arrives at the beach wearing a sweet and playful new look for the summer celebration. Determined to win new fans on a new stage, she is ready to give her most passionate performance yet!]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400173 = [[
On the breezy beach, Rabbie switches into a sweet waitress outfit and strikes a lively pose for the stall. She wants to put a smile on everyone's faces with the Rediesel Desert's finest cuisine, and her Hellfire Burger is just as hot as her passion for service!
However, this burger has eventually turned the beach into a battlefield for spice lovers... Is anyone brave enough to complete the challenge?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601863 = "Springtime means picnics, and picnics mean warm sunshine, soft breezes, tasty food, and you. Will she finally express her feelings to the one she holds most dear? Regardless of the outcome, she will cherish every moment of the time together... even if it only lasts a single day in the spring.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501004 = [[
Within the Black Box is the Starry Crypt, a place where summer's fireworks will never reach. Your intrusion disturbs the strange beauty of this place, as well as the peace of its watcher.
In this mystical mire, her black gauze swimsuit looks especially alluring, but remember to stay close to her side. As much as she enjoys your company, she does not want this to be your final resting place...]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500213 = [[
The ocean's tides are unfeeling, but there is meaning behind the fallen flowers.
In a reef surrounded by flower petals stands a magnificent and melancholy figure: the creator of this vast sea. Soaked by the waves, he becomes a part of this beautiful view of the ocean.
But this masterpiece is still missing one final, crucial piece. Will you join him and complete his perfect work of art?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602333 = "Under the sun, the beach sparkles, and the azure sea is absolutely stunning, but her smile outshines it. This summer adventure is about to end, but these precious memories, and the ones who made them possible, will forever shine in her heart.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1501903 = [[
Even the most dazzling of gems inlaid in a courtyard will only sparkle under the sun's radiant light. But there are those who shine even brighter simply by sitting there.
As you struggle to make ends meet, you encounter Matthieu enjoying an extravagant vacation. What kinds of challenges will you face together?]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602273 = "The sea breeze plays a gentle tune as the waves wash over the wings of the eagle. The girl, with her skateboard as her wings, soars over the waves, reloading her weapon as she goes. It may be a laid-back vacation, but don't be fooled—her precious smile packs a punch. Watch out! The water gun shows no mercy.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1601733 = [[
Under the full moon, the light slices through the darkness, and flickering firelight dances in the midst of sobs. He returns fulfilled, like a lone rose in a castle. His tidy, elegant suit hides the tattered, stained shirt he hasn't had time to change. He glances sideways through the room bathed in moonlight.
"I don't have much patience for food."]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602183 = "Lounging on the sofa, the luxurious dress drapes perfectly over her figure. The scent of red wine blends with the golden light in the room. A drunken serpent lies lazily in the pool of wine, both beautiful and dangerous. Catching your gaze, she gives a sweet smile and invites you closer.",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1500973 = [[
"The redemption of the soul is more crucial than curing the body."
In the cold night, the sharp edge of the Icy Lancet flashes briefly. As a heavy object hits the ground, the assassin vanishes into the shadows. He's a great doctor who understands that to truly heal, you must eradicate the source of the suffering.]],
  str_pet_skin_desc_1400953 = "The city's neon lights can't contain the ranger from the wilderness. No one has ever seen her true face, but she instantly becomes the center of attention wherever she goes. It's not just her tightly wrapped outfit but her free spirit that captivates everyone.",
  str_pet_skin_name_1602063 = "Blue Sky Holiday",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1602063 = "What could be more comfortable than lying here in bliss?\nNo tasks to complete, no battles to fight, and no need to seek out a meaning for anything—the sole meaning of this moment is simply to let go and enjoy.\nSee, even the white dove fluttering outside my window agrees.",
  str_pet_skin_name_1701103 = "Silent Saint",
  str_pet_skin_desc_1701103 = [[
In the harsh, frozen Northland, people persevere through the snow and wind. They say the Silent Saint's guidance inspires their steadfast belief.
But she said people triumphed over storms, thunder, and the biting cold. They even vanquished monstrous creatures. This was no mere gift, but a testament to their own extraordinary power.
My work here is finished. A true leader will now rise among them.
When her story ended, and the countless noises in her heart quieted, she shone with a genuine smile.]]
}
return config
